{
    "title": "Kids Storybook \u00b7 Truth & Tales",
    "description": "<b>Truth & Tales</b> is perfect for parents looking for a great learning storytime: epic books for kids, audio books and bedtime stories for kids that spark imagination and foster learning. Our award-winning app makes screen time educational and fun, supporting children's growth.\r\n\r\n<h2>KEY FEATURES:</h2>\r\n\ud83d\udcda <b>Interactive Kids Storybook:</b> Beautifully illustrated interactive story books for kids that captivate young minds and encourage a love for reading and learning.\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 <b>Audio Books for Kids:</b> Our audio books provide a relaxing and engaging listening experience with great bedtime stories for kids.\r\n\ud83c\udf19 <b>Calm Storytime:</b> We provide a low-stimulation environment, with calm interactive storybook, soothing audio storytime, and relaxing activities.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Creative Games:</b> Fun coloring activities based on characters from our story books.\r\n\ud83e\udd38 <b>Move It:</b> Encourage healthy habits with fun animal-inspired exercises that keep children active and promote a strong mind-body connection.\r\n\r\n<h2>WHY PARENTS LOVE TRUTH AND TALES STORYTIME:</h2>\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b>Learning Storytime:</b> Our interactive and bedtime story books for kids are developed by experts to support emotional, cognitive, and physical growth, making learning fun and meaningful. \r\n\ud83d\udd0a <b>Read-Aloud Feature:</b> Ideal for early readers, our kids storybooks come with read-aloud narration and subtitles, boosting literacy and comprehension. \r\n\u2764\ufe0f <b>Safe and Trusted:</b> Certified for quality, we provide a secure space where children can enjoy interactive books, audiobooks, and bedtime stories for kids without ads.\r\n\r\nTransform storytime with Truth & Tales! Download now to explore a world of epic story books for kids, audiobooks for kids, and enchanting bedtime stories for kids that inspire creativity, learning, and joy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Truth &amp; Tales</b> is perfect for parents looking for a great learning storytime: epic books for kids, audio books and bedtime stories for kids that spark imagination and foster learning. Our award-winning app makes screen time educational and fun, supporting children&#39;s growth.<br><br><h2>KEY FEATURES:</h2><br>\ud83d\udcda <b>Interactive Kids Storybook:</b> Beautifully illustrated interactive story books for kids that captivate young minds and encourage a love for reading and learning.<br>\ud83c\udfa7 <b>Audio Books for Kids:</b> Our audio books provide a relaxing and engaging listening experience with great bedtime stories for kids.<br>\ud83c\udf19 <b>Calm Storytime:</b> We provide a low-stimulation environment, with calm interactive storybook, soothing audio storytime, and relaxing activities.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Creative Games:</b> Fun coloring activities based on characters from our story books.<br>\ud83e\udd38 <b>Move It:</b> Encourage healthy habits with fun animal-inspired exercises that keep children active and promote a strong mind-body connection.<br><br><h2>WHY PARENTS LOVE TRUTH AND TALES STORYTIME:</h2><br>\ud83c\udf1f <b>Learning Storytime:</b> Our interactive and bedtime story books for kids are developed by experts to support emotional, cognitive, and physical growth, making learning fun and meaningful. <br>\ud83d\udd0a <b>Read-Aloud Feature:</b> Ideal for early readers, our kids storybooks come with read-aloud narration and subtitles, boosting literacy and comprehension. <br>\u2764\ufe0f <b>Safe and Trusted:</b> Certified for quality, we provide a secure space where children can enjoy interactive books, audiobooks, and bedtime stories for kids without ads.<br><br>Transform storytime with Truth &amp; Tales! Download now to explore a world of epic story books for kids, audiobooks for kids, and enchanting bedtime stories for kids that inspire creativity, learning, and joy.",
